# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .env holds SECRET_KEY, ENCRYPTION_KEY and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY. Never commit it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data — DO NOT COMMIT, DO NOT "CLEAN UP" THIS RULE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# backend/data/ is the application's private state directory. It contains:
#   app.db             the SQLite database (accounts, jobs, applications)
#   browser_profiles/  live LinkedIn session cookies — equivalent to a password
#   resumes/           the user's uploaded CVs (personal data)
#   screenshots/       page captures taken while debugging a run
#   .secrets.env       keys generated by the Docker entrypoint on first boot
# Committing any of it leaks a working LinkedIn session and personal documents.
backend/data/

